      "case_id": "implement-ttl-lru-cache-typescript",
      "category": "implement",
      "language": "typescript",
      "max_tokens": 1536,
      "min_completion_tokens": 768,
      "user_lines": [
        "Implement `TtlLruCache<K, V>` in TypeScript to satisfy the interface and the behavior notes below.",
        "O(1) get/set/delete, lazy expiry plus an explicit `prune()`, an `onEvict` callback with a reason,",
        "and no timers. Then write `node:test` tests for every behavior note. Output two complete files.",
        "",
        "```ts",
        "export type EvictReason = \"capacity\" | \"expired\" | \"deleted\" | \"cleared\";",
        "",
        "export interface CacheOptions<K, V> {",
        "  maxEntries: number;            // > 0",
        "  defaultTtlMs: number;          // > 0",
        "  now?: () => number;            // injectable clock, defaults to Date.now",
        "  onEvict?: (key: K, value: V, reason: EvictReason) => void;",
        "}",
        "",
        "export interface TtlLru<K, V> {",
        "  get(key: K): V | undefined;             // refreshes recency, not TTL",
        "  peek(key: K): V | undefined;            // no recency change",
        "  set(key: K, value: V, ttlMs?: number): void;",
        "  delete(key: K): boolean;",
        "  prune(): number;                        // returns count of expired entries removed",
        "  clear(): void;",
        "  readonly size: number;                  // excludes expired entries",
        "}",
        "```",
        "",
        "Behavior notes:",
        "1. `set` on an existing key replaces the value, resets TTL, and marks it most recent; it does not call onEvict.",
        "2. When inserting beyond maxEntries, evict the least recently used non-expired entry with reason \"capacity\";",
        "   expired entries are removed first with reason \"expired\".",
        "3. `get`/`peek` of an expired key returns undefined and evicts it with reason \"expired\".",
        "4. `size` never counts expired entries, even before prune.",
        "5. An onEvict callback that throws must not corrupt cache state; rethrow after the mutation completes.",
        "6. ttlMs <= 0 or non-finite is a RangeError."
      ],
      "temperature": 0,
      "stream": false
    },
